Z||000000||87PegasusGT||12-28-1999||04:23 PM||||Hey guys. While researching the 3.8l SC Intercooled, I realized the total bill after mods will be upwards of 6K. I don't know about you, but that's a lot of jack for me to come up with.<BR>Anyone know anything about turbocharging a 3.4l (iron block)? I figure there will be less money spent on installation mods and engine itself. ||||reg||6
Z||000001||terryk||12-28-1999||05:33 PM||||And how did you plan on intercooling the 3800 SC? I looked at intercooling mine and it is a major can of worms. The Thrasher IC project is unlikely to ever see the light of day. Very impractical.<P>A stock Buick SC would perform better than the turbo 3.4L. More torque right off the line. Lots more torque .....||||reg||1
